    "updated_at": "2022-08-27T09:48:20Z",
    "body": "I think I tried to implement this in the update rendering steps: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=237273#c1 , it's the easiest way (since you don't have to find every single place where \"is this element focusable?\" changes and hook it up there).\r\n\r\nIt works, although the spec implies we should do synchronously and not async, so I just left it there for now.\r\n\r\n",
