    "created_at": "2022-08-29T18:36:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-29T18:36:34Z",
    "body": "Yeah I tried to make it synchronous, but since style changes can affect focusability, then things like `document.activeElement`, `document.querySelector(\":focus\")`, etc. need to flush styles, which seems bad for perf. And several tests failed, so probably not web compatible, but I don't remember the details.\r\n\r\nThen I agree that doing it in \"update the rendering\" seems more reasonable.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
