    "created_at": "2022-09-01T18:56:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-09-01T18:56:08Z",
    "body": "So, there seemed to be consensus today on doing this at some point during update the rendering. I sent a patch updating the tests here: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1788741\r\n\r\nHowever, that uncovers a case where all browsers are interoperable in removing focus synchronously, which is focused element removal.\r\n\r\nNot sure to what extent we want that to be special, do we want to keep that behavior? It might be reasonable.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
